@FirstMcpServer_HostAddress = http://localhost:5129

### Get current weather for Islamabad
GET {{FirstMcpServer_HostAddress}}/api/weather?latitude=33.6844&longitude=73.0479
Accept: application/json

### Get current weather for a different location (London)
GET {{FirstMcpServer_HostAddress}}/api/weather?latitude=51.5072&longitude=-0.1276
Accept: application/json
